# Allow-list: the image needs only the web app source, the API and (when it
# has been trained) the hazard classifier. Everything else stays out of the
# build context: data/ (crime CSV), node_modules, .venv, .env files, .git,
# .claude/ (agent worktrees), CrimeRadar/ (Java app and its build), ml/output, ...
*

!apps/web/
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/dist/

!apps/api/requirements.txt
!apps/api/app/

# Hazard classifier (git-ignored, optional): included only if it exists at build time.
!ml/hazard/output/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
